/si.imgix.net/9523fba8/uploads/origins/9e2c67d1-cf38-4c49-9ff8-d0655ef7efd5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d338afb45aa6db4d625c81637008003 3x"}, "body": "Howdy!! I received your appeal to draw me and i would be thrilled if you could!\n\nIll let you decide what to do for the art, ill just give a brief description of my VTuber!\n\nHis name is Ace Ayune, he's a magic oracle femboy that's 4'9\" (148 cm), he's very chaotic, mischievous, and sometimes lewd. He loves cute things and can be flustered easily, but can also be aggressive, though he's not very intimidating since he's very short. A lot of his backstory has to do with space, sunsets, and monsters like Cthulhu!\n\nPlease draw him however you\u2019d like, and please include a PNG version of the artwork!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cBAN5pi71M3rhvWiP_L7fTWVyQ2lBo66", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2357384, "client_id": 552598, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5894628641773bad91e09b11d66d522", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5894628641773bad91e09b11d66d522, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a205389372fa690d0c7c8dd08435b6d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=540c6cd2170f7bc679fa4b78b47ab1e5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd568cdc634a043b66c643ed9e8e914f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd568cdc634a043b66c643ed9e8e914f, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b4fd70c6c979f588bd4fafecb939e8c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=adcd7ab19317b32f5ce69795f53e343d 3x"}, "body": "Thanks for your request!\nI'd like you to draw my My Hero Academia original character, the half-american, half-japanese heroine in training Loanstar. https://imgur.com/a/iY2VvXO\nShe's a strong country gal that loves the outdoors and wants to be as strong as she can be to protect herself and others.\nA cowgirl through and through, she's a fair bit of a tomboy with her messy hair and competitive nature, but isn't afraid to do girly things she likes.\nHer quirk allows her to grab and siphon mass from things to shrink them, or give mass to other stuff to make it larger, including people, causing her hands to emit a wispy mist.\n\nFeel free to draw her doing whatever you feel appropriate for her!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@testmfos/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2357384, "client_id": 790541, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66079b0f/uploads/origins/81c287d5-2e86-4c